@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans JP
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequence {
    ActorFontSize 18
    ActorFontStyle bold
    ParticipantFontSize 16
    NoteFontSize 14
    MessageFontSize 14
    BoxPadding 6
    ParticipantPadding 12
}
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam titleFontSize 20

title リスト共有

autonumber

actor "ユーザー" as User
participant "アプリ" as App
participant "Sync"
participant "Friends"
participant "Storage"
participant "中継Server" as WSServer
participant "相手" as Peer

== 生成側 ==
User -> App: リスト共有
App -> Sync: 共有データ作成
Sync -> Storage: 一覧取得
Storage --> Sync: 一覧
Sync -> App: QR / URL / コード表示
App -> Friends: WebSocket待機
Friends -> WSServer: join(roomId)
WSServer --> Friends: 待機中

== スキャン側 ==
User -> App: QRスキャン / URL入力
App -> Friends: データ読込
Friends -> Storage: 友達＋一覧保存
Friends -> WSServer: join(roomId)
WSServer -> Peer: user-joined
note right #ffd: お互いに自動で友達追加

@enduml
